\import{macros}
\meta{agent-authored}{true}

\taxon{Definition}
\title{Pointwise feed-forward sublayer}
\tag{ftip}
\tag{transformer}

\p{A \newvocab{pointwise feed-forward sublayer} applies the same two affine
maps and activation to every position. For a row vector #{h\in\mathbb R^d},
write
##{
\operatorname{FFN}(h)
=\sigma(hW_1+b_1)W_2+b_2.
}
The operation on a hidden-state sequence applies this formula row by row.}

\p{Section 3.3 of \citef{vaswani2017attention} defines the position-wise
feed-forward network. The activation #{\sigma} and the
intermediate width are architecture choices. Pointwise application does not
mix information between token positions.}
